","strong":"H8111"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11780,"title":"II Chronicles 28:16","segments":["¶At that time did king Ahaz send unto the kings of Assyria to help him."],"ref":"II Chronicles 28:16","verse":16,"words":[{"text":"¶At that time","strong":"H6256"},{"text":" did king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" Ahaz","strong":"H271"},{"text":" send","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" unto the kings","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Assyria","strong":"H804"},{"text":" to help","strong":"H5826"},{"text":" him."}]},{"id":11781,"title":"II Chronicles 28:17","segments":["For again the Edomites had come and smitten Judah, and carried away captives. {captives: Heb. a captivity}"],"ref":"II Chronicles 28:17","verse":17,"words":[{"text":"For again the Edomites","strong":"H130"},{"text":" had come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" and smitten","strong":"H5221"},{"text":" Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":", and carried away","strong":"H7617"},{"text":" captives","strong":"H7628"},{"text":". {captives: Heb. a captivity}"}]},{"id":11782,"title":"II Chronicles 28:18","segments":["The Philistines also had invaded the cities of the low country, and of the south of Judah, and had taken Bethshemesh, and Ajalon, and Gederoth, and Shocho with the villages thereof, and Timnah with the villages thereof, Gimzo also and the villages thereof: and they dwelt there."],"ref":"II Chronicles 28:18","verse":18,"words":[{"text":"The Philistines","strong":"H6430"},{"text":" also had invaded","strong":"H6584"},{"text":" the cities","strong":"H5892"},{"text":" of the low country","strong":"H8219"},{"text":", and of the south","strong":"H5045"},{"text":" of Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":", and had taken","strong":"H3920"},{"text":" Bethshemesh","strong":"H1053"},{"text":", and Ajalon","strong":"H357"},{"text":", and Gederoth","strong":"H1450"},{"text":", and Shocho","strong":"H7755"},{"text":" with the villages","strong":"H1323"},{"text":" thereof, and Timnah","strong":"H8553"},{"text":" with the villages","strong":"H1323"}